> domain atan2(y: real, x: real)
domain of atan2(y, x):
  y: real (default [-10, 10])
  x: real (default [-10, 10])
  requires (y, x) != (0, 0)  (atan2: the angle of the origin is undefined)
  defined at 10200 of 10201 points
  undefined e.g. at y=0, x=0
  over all 10201 points of the domain
